[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"07280347-b147-402a-930e-f6c717ccc899","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h1 class=\"align-center\">ABOUT US</h1>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"71c7b670-19ce-4ce2-88b1-0ffa8a1215b5","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h2 class=\"align-center\"><br>LACCICO – SHOELACES FROM THE SHOEMAKER</h2>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}}},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"56ee227b-84af-4188-a6af-5c860bf97021","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"beb0ed78-510b-4740-87e0-fa6f66f03d51","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":""},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"e79dc6ca-be5d-4ea1-8b52-f488dd2f27ea","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h2><strong>Why we make the simple things perfect.</strong></h2>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"df52b3c3-a0fd-48c4-9dae-a3acb9b5fc55","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>LACCICO stands for quality, tradition and European craftsmanship. The name combines the Italian <strong>“LACCI”</strong> (laces) with the ambition of a specialised <strong>“CO”</strong> (company). Following Italian phonetics, the name is pronounced <strong>[ˈlatʃiko]</strong> – with the stress on the first syllable. The idea was born where craftsmanship is at home: on our travels together through the workshops of Italy.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":1},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"1175f04d-7ba9-4c51-b1fb-586062238850","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>The vision:</strong></h3><h3><strong>A bridge between worlds</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":2},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"0d84a474-2994-4159-bc4a-bfa0dcb67c2d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Together with my partner Annette – an artist and church musician with a fine sense of aesthetics and rhythm – I noticed a clear gap in quality on our travels. While in Italy we admired the merits of high-quality waxed laces on fine footwear, the accessory trade at home offered almost nothing but simple, often short-lived mass-produced goods.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":3},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"7a630575-938d-4be6-b5cc-18f9cd752d87","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Inspired by the Italian devotion to detail, we decided to close this gap. We wanted to make the exceptional quality that is otherwise found almost only in the original equipment of fine Italian shoes available to everyone as a reliable accessory, exclusively through our direct sales.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":4}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"8f153a11-c263-41a4-a3da-b68b77d53bc6","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"f4e0e326-8222-4efe-a5eb-cf332c740602","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/en/business-elegant-shoes"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"38da9712-7952-429c-a9c6-6e1c06b05426","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"724","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"12b661e0-3b5f-4bce-b65e-d4ec8ab01f07","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"4977e179-b5a9-4902-841b-32c07967b134","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"738","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"5da8e88e-c4fc-4f6b-a982-c32b9fe21af3","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/en/laccico-finest-waxed-laces/info"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"0b350d18-6325-406b-9ba5-08bd0d6e2b20","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"72c2076d-0c8d-4554-9165-72e6a4a78bef","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>The master shoemaker:</strong></h3><h3><strong>Expertise since 1986</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"7043f337-979b-4074-87c0-3b44305349d0","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p><br>As a trained shoemaker with a master craftsman's title (earned in 1995), I see shoes not as fashion objects but as constructions. Since the late 1980s I have got to know dozens of workshops, tanneries and suppliers across Europe in depth. I know how leather works and how pressure has to be distributed in a shoe.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":1},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"b64bd669-7655-430d-b7d1-fe52776db89e","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p><br></p><p>This knowledge goes into every choice of our products. At LACCICO there are no compromises: I check every batch personally – with the trained eye of the master and the touch of a craftsman who knows what matters.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":2},{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"017fe708-a67e-4fb3-baed-e98d001480a5","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"729","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"7e3aff57-61af-40bb-ad26-7d1f18a054bd","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"1edd04df-7627-42ff-ac8e-125dd946a6d3","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"749","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"7785f042-f75b-49dd-81e2-7ca69b273d76","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>The selection:</strong></h3><h3><strong>A European alliance of quality</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"e86ff3ee-90a0-4d49-94a8-3dcd971f9447","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>We have our laces made where the tradition of braiding lives on. In a long-established <strong>“Trecchificio”</strong> (braiding mill) in Tuscany and in a specialised partner company in Poland, our laces are made from high-quality yarns.</p><p>This is <strong>OEM quality (Original Equipment Manufacturer)</strong>, as chosen by renowned Italian shoe brands for their original equipment. Only a small part of these exclusive goods reaches the open market – we make this quality available to you.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":1}]},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"7a49483c-1ca0-4aed-b065-655ccf8a0af9","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs_286_1381"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}}},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"9b79ab39-1269-4187-a084-dfa51d967d50","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"ddfce522-698c-4e79-8bec-24083ec21a50","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>Our philosophy:</strong></h3><h3><strong>The detail makes the difference</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"a6b7d472-b927-4276-90fa-21b5092e8616","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>A LACCICO lace is a well-thought-out accessory. It has to be tear-resistant, yet stay supple. It has to shine and still offer a good grip. With our special waxing and the dense construction of the braid, we offer a product that ages like a good shoe: with character and dignity.</p><p>We invite you to feel the difference. Because perfection begins where others stop looking – at the shoelace.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":1},{"name":"Carousel","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"985061d4-4028-47b7-adc1-873846f194c3","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"controls":{"color":"#000000","displayArrows":true},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"content":[{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"1d259598-8564-491a-a75f-b462a5394726","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/en/"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}}},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"f9004c07-0d6e-477b-a7f8-29d993ef364e","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0034_Lilla.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0034_Lilla.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0034_Lilla.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0034_Lilla.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/en/"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}}},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"06a20aaf-952e-4282-84bc-7f4f5d1dd66d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0027_Bordo.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0027_Bordo.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0027_Bordo.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0027_Bordo.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/en/"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":